00:20:09.007 --> 00:20:11.443
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the Donate button.

00:20:11.443 --> 00:20:13.011
Stay safe.
Wash your hands.

00:20:13.011 --> 00:20:14.746
Wear a mask.
We love you.

